            "start": 112,
            "end": 118
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:energy#e-2af9e4bf3e5e4446",
          "text": "This energy transition（变革）is global, and the amount of renewable energy the world will need is “a little bit mind-blowing,” says mechanical engineer Keith Wipke at the National Renewable Energy Laboratory.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2025-i",
