            "end": 105
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:energy#e-157f920188d72ff2",
          "text": "They consist of an electric motor which collects energy used in the braking action that would be lost as heat by conventional brakes.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2026-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2026年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（全国II卷）英语学科试题卷",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2026-ii:reading-d",
