            "start": 49,
            "end": 55
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:energy#e-f7933914f5d75fd2",
          "text": "That energy can be immediately used to accelerate (加速) the vehicle or, in the case of the Barcelona subway system, sent along cables to supply electricity for the station or for electric car chargers.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2026-ii",
